{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45319","headline":"效古 · 皎然","name":"效古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出天地正，煌煌辟晨曦。\n六龙驱羣动，古今无尽时。\n夸父亦何愚，竞走先自疲。\n饮乾咸池水，折尽扶桑枝。\n渴死化爝火，嗟嗟徒尔爲。\n空留邓林在，折尽令人嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}